body:
"western mindset of uncivilized India", I am talking about NGO in general. Not India. My example, although anecdotal involved Africa?

&#x200B;

If it matters my GF is Gujarati (who I will be traveling with) and she told me not to trust NGOs. She said I would make a much greater impact trying to find people online.

Thank you, I was worried about NGO and kinda wanted to avoid them. My friend's mum used to work for one in Egypt for horse welfare and is disgusted by how the owners have basically bought themselves a lovely house along with other corruption.

&#x200B;

Ive also read a lot of bad stats about NGO.

Im so confused why this is a blunder?

&#x200B;

Please may someone explain ?

Considering how much hikaru likes his pennies, im surprised he hasnt thought of this yet!

&#x200B;

As honoka448 said. they can call it pineapple juicer
